  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01725-000:DescriptionOfFactAndReasonWhyComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesAreNotPresentedTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(2) 【主な資産及び負債の内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;　　　連結財務諸表を作成しているため、記載を省略しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp030000-asr_E01725-000:DescriptionOfFactAndReasonWhyComponentsOfMajorAssetsAndLiabilitiesAreNotPresentedTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head3"&gt;(3) 【その他】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;  &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherInformationFinancialStatementsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:OverviewOfOperationalProceduresForSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
